  "title": "The Last Priest of Eli's Line",
  "era": "united-kingdom",
  "lifespan": "c. 1050–970 BC",
  "summary": "Abiathar was the son of the priest Ahimelech and the sole survivor of the massacre at Nob. He fled to David and served as a priest throughout David's reign, but was eventually deposed by Solomon because he supported Adonija as heir to the throne.",
